{"version":1,"content":"<p>聯合國開發計劃署（UNDP）周一（12日）發表最新年度報告，顯示全球貧窮指數自2010年創立以來首次上升，受影響人口增至12億，主要原因與部分發展中國家人口上升有關。</p><p>至於進展最迅速的，包括中國及越南等亞洲國家。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T08:22:55.234151+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T07:30:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T16:37:49.729715+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T08:17:42.947108+00:00","content_hash":"4f31d516ef295dcf209a9dbab1038ca3a07875fd797cc25c8a22a419f4527210","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}